Article 2 (Standards for Remuneration) Trainees shall be paid salaries based on the following standards, salary adjustment allowances prescribed in the Public Officials Remuneration Regulations, and regular attendance allowances and family allowances prescribed in the Rules on Allowances, etc. for Judges and Court Officials: <Amended on February 10, 2000; February 10, 2001; November 24, 2001; January 18, 2002; January 17, 2003; January 28, 2004; January 27, 2005; February 21, 2006; March 8, 2007; February 18, 2008; January 31, 2011; February 24, 2012; February 18, 2013; February 7, 2014; February 17, 2015; March 10, 2016; March 31, 2017; March 29, 2018; March 5, 2019; March 4, 2020; February 26, 2021; February 25, 2022; February 24, 2023; February 22, 2024; February 28, 2025; March 3, 2026>
1. A trainee undergoing training during the first-year period prescribed in Article 35 (1) of the Rules on Operation of the Judicial Research and Training Institute (hereinafter referred to as the "Rules"): 2,262,000 won per month;
2. A trainee undergoing training during the second-year period prescribed in Article 35 (1) of the Rules: 2,363,500 won per month;
3. A trainee repeating a year and undergoing training again under Article 41 (1) of the Rules, or undergoing retraining under Article 44 (1) of the Rules: 200,000 won per month.
